@startuml Room-Lifecycle-State
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

title UpDown QnD — Room State Machine\nStates: waiting → countdown/hostControl → revealing → exchange → finished → waiting\n<color:green>FIXED (Task 35): resetForReplay() returns room to 'waiting'</color>\n<color:blue>Task 37: Host can toggle countdown OFF → manual 'Force Next Round'</color>

[*] --> waiting : Room created\n(RoomManager.createRoom)

state "waiting" as W #A5D6A7 {
  W : Players can join/leave
  W : Host can add bots
  W : Host can start game
  W : Lobby countdown (30s) may auto-start
}

state "countdown" as CD #FFE082 {
  CD : 10-second round timer
  CD : Players submit guesses (PLAY_CARD)
  CD : Players play special cards
  CD : Timer ticks broadcast to all
  CD : countdownEnabled = true
}

state "hostControl" as HC #E1BEE7 {
  HC : No timer — host controls pace
  HC : Players submit guesses (PLAY_CARD)
  HC : Players play special cards
  HC : Host sees 'Force Next Round' button
  HC : Auto-resolve when allPlayed
  HC : countdownEnabled = false
}

state "revealing" as RV #FFF3E0 {
  RV : Round resolved
  RV : Scores calculated
  RV : Eliminations processed
  RV : ROUND_RESULT broadcast
}

state "exchange" as EX #E3F2FD {
  EX : 3-second pause between rounds
  EX : Players can JOIN during exchange
  EX : Next round auto-starts after 3s
}

state "finished" as FIN #FFE082 {
  FIN : GAME_OVER broadcast
  FIN : Leaderboard + diamonds shown
  FIN : Players click 'Play Again'
  FIN : <color:green>resetForReplay() resets to 'waiting'</color>
  FIN : Host can REMOVE_ROOM (Task 41)
}

state "removed" as DEL <<end>>

FIN --> DEL : host.removeRoom()\nREMOVE_ROOM (host only)
FIN --> DEL : autoCleanup()\nstale + 0 connected players\n(triggered on CREATE_ROOM)

W --> CD : host.startGame()\ncountdownEnabled=true\n[uc:560d9a46]
W --> HC : host.startGame()\ncountdownEnabled=false
W --> CD : lobbyCountdown=0\n(auto-start for preset rooms)

W : host.toggleCountdown()\nsets countdownEnabled on/off\nbefore starting game

CD --> RV : allPlayed OR timeout\n[uc:b3fb6696] [uc:34620f4b]\nGameRoom.ts:444-445
CD --> FIN : deck empty before round\nGameRoom.ts:326,332

HC --> RV : allPlayed\n(auto-resolve when\nall alive players guessed)
HC --> RV : host.forceResolve()\n'Force Next Round' button\n(resolves even if not all played)
HC --> FIN : deck empty before round

RV --> FIN : alivePlayers === 0\n[uc:38d62fef]\nGameRoom.ts:449
RV --> FIN : deck + gmHand empty\n[uc:e73e7784]\nGameRoom.ts:543
RV --> EX : players alive + cards remain\nGameRoom.ts:546
RV --> CD : solo mode (no exchange)\ncountdownEnabled=true
RV --> HC : solo mode (no exchange)\ncountdownEnabled=false

EX --> CD : after 3s setTimeout\ncountdownEnabled=true\nnextRound()
EX --> HC : after 3s setTimeout\ncountdownEnabled=false\nnextRound()

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' REPLAY: finished → waiting (IMPLEMENTED Task 35)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

FIN -[#green]-> W : <color:green>PLAY_AGAIN → resetForReplay()</color>\n<color:green>state→'waiting', keep players+chat+bots</color>

note right of FIN
  **Replay Flow (IMPLEMENTED — Task 35+36)**

  1. endGame() sets state='finished'
  2. Client receives GAME_OVER
  3. Player clicks 'Play Again'
  4. Client sends PLAY_AGAIN message
  5. Server: room.resetForReplay()
     - state → 'waiting'
     - reset scores, alive, deck, hands
     - keep players connected
     - keep chat history (Task 35 fix)
     - keep bots alive (Task 36 fix)
  6. Server broadcasts ROOM_RESET
  7. All clients re-render lobby
  8. Host starts new game when ready
end note

note right of HC
  **Host Control Mode (countdown OFF)**

  **Toggle:** Host clicks toggle in lobby
  before starting game. Sets room option
  countdownEnabled = false.

  **During round:**
  - No 10s timer runs
  - Players guess at their own pace
  - Host sees "Force Next Round" button
  - allPlayed still auto-resolves
  - Host can force-resolve early

  **Use case:** Teaching, demo, casual
  play where time pressure unwanted.

  **Implementation:**
  - GameRoom: countdownEnabled field
  - startCountdown(): skip if !enabled
  - New MSG: FORCE_RESOLVE (host only)
  - UI: toggle switch in lobby settings
  - UI: "Force Next Round" btn for host
end note

note left of W
  **Join guards (addPlayer):**
  - size >= maxPlayers → reject [R7]
  - state !== 'waiting' AND
    state !== 'exchange' → reject [R9]
  - state === 'exchange' → OK [R8]

  Replay bypasses join guards:
  resetForReplay() sets state='waiting'
  so existing players stay connected,
  no rejoin needed.
end note

@enduml
